        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The rejection message you see when the assistant's cloud-based skill settings fail to save now names the specific skill and field that caused the problem. Previously, this error was a generic note that did not say which part of your setup was wrong, making it difficult to find and fix the issue. This is an internal improvement to error handling; no new features are added, and you do not need to change any of your own settings to benefit.",
